        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwamakumi asatu n'omusanvu (37) nga kyabazinga Yoashi n'afuga Buyudaaya, Yehoashi mutabane wa Yehoahazi yaafuuka kyabazinga wa Isiraeli, era yaafugira mu Samaria okumala entangama ya myaka ikumi na mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeena yaakola ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda, ng'oti n'ebya kyabazinga Yeroboamu ebyaleetera Isiraeli okwonoona. Era Yehoashi oyo yaaloba kuleka bibi ebyo, aye yaaja bwa mu maiso na kubikola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Yehoashi bye yakola, omuli n'eby'amaani bye yakola ng'ali kulwanisa Amazia kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yehoashi yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, era yaaziikibwa e Samaria mu lwambiidhi lwa bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli. Mutabane we Yeroboamu yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
