        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yehoashi owa Isiraeli, mutabane wa Yehoahazi, yaaghangula Benihadadi emikuzi esatu, yaamutoolaku ebibuga bya Isiraeli, Benihadadi oyo bye yali anhaze ng'alwanisa Yehoahazi lata wa Yehoashi oyo.",
